# type|value|expect(ok|bad)|normalised(optional; <empty> = must normalise to empty)|why
# Shared by tests/test-config.sh (bash) and tests/powershell/Test-Settings.ps1 so both validators agree.
ip|192.168.1.150|ok||ip: valid
ip|192.168.1.256|bad||ip: 256 octet
ip|192.168.1|bad||ip: too few octets
ip|192.168.01.5|bad||ip: leading zero
ip|1.2.3.4;rm|bad||ip: injection attempt
cidr|192.168.1.150/24|ok|192.168.1.0/24|cidr: normalised to the network
cidr|10.1.2.3/16|ok|10.1.0.0/16|cidr: /16
cidr|192.168.1.0/32|bad||cidr: prefix too long
cidr|192.168.1.0|bad||cidr: no prefix
port|9119|ok||port: ok
port|0|bad||port: zero
port|65536|bad||port: too big
port|80a|bad||port: junk
int:1-10|3|ok|3|int range: ok
int:1-10|0|bad||int range: below
int:1-10|11|bad||int range: above
int:1-10|007|ok|7|int range: leading zero normalised
bool01|Yes|ok|1|bool: yes
bool01|0|ok|0|bool: 0
bool01|maybe|bad||bool: maybe
unixuser|ai-node|ok||unixuser: ok
unixuser|AiNode|bad||unixuser: upper case
unixuser|root|bad||unixuser: root refused
ghname|acme-corp|ok||ghname: ok
ghname|-acme|bad||ghname: leading hyphen
ghname|ac--me|bad||ghname: double hyphen
ghname|acme/api|bad||ghname: slash
repos|  api   web |ok|api web|repos: list normalised
repos|acme/api|bad||repos: owner/name refused
repos||bad||repos: empty
noreply|42+acme-hermes@users.noreply.github.com|ok||noreply: with id
noreply|acme-hermes@users.noreply.github.com|ok||noreply: without id
noreply|me@gmail.com|bad||noreply: other domain
model|vendor/model-3.5|ok||model: ok
model|vendor/model:free|ok||model: with :free tag
model|justaname|bad||model: no vendor
model||bad||model: empty
optmodel||ok|<empty>|optmodel: empty ok
optmodel|-|ok|<empty>|optmodel: dash clears
optmodel|nonsense|bad||optmodel: junk
gguf|Qwen3.5-9B-UD-Q5_K_XL.gguf|ok||gguf: ok
gguf|model.bin|bad||gguf: wrong extension
url|https://huggingface.co/a/b/resolve/main/x.gguf|ok||url: https ok
url|http://example.com/x|bad||url: http refused
url|https://x.com/a b|bad||url: space refused
time|1:00|ok|01:00|time: pads the hour
time|23:59|ok|23:59|time: ok
time|24:00|bad||time: 24h refused
time|01:60|bad||time: minutes
winpath|C:\llama|ok||winpath: ok
winpath|D:\models\|ok|D:\models|winpath: trailing slash stripped
winpath|C:\my models|bad||winpath: spaces refused
winpath|/srv/models|bad||winpath: unix path refused
alias|qwen3.5-9b|ok||alias: ok
choice:a,b,c|b|ok||choice: ok
choice:a,b,c|d|bad||choice: other
ghname|yourorg|bad||placeholder: yourorg refused
text|a'b|bad||quote injection refused
text|a$(id)|bad||dollar injection refused
text|a`id`|bad||backtick refused
alias|a\b|bad||backslash refused outside winpath
alias|on|bad||YAML would read it as a boolean
alias|Yes|bad||YAML boolean, any case
alias|null|bad||YAML null
alias|7b|bad||must start with a letter
alias|qwen3.5-9b|ok||normal model name
cidr|10.0.0.1/08|ok|10.0.0.0/8|leading-zero prefix is not octal
cidr|10.0.0.1/09|ok|10.0.0.0/9|leading-zero prefix is not octal
repos|*|bad||a glob is not a repository name
repos|api *|bad||a glob among real names
repos|api   web|ok|api web|whitespace is squeezed
port|1|ok||lowest port
port|65535|ok||highest port
port|65536|bad||one past the highest
int:1-10|10|ok|10|upper bound
int:1-10|11|bad||past the upper bound
int:1-10|1|ok|1|lower bound
time|00:00|ok|00:00|midnight
time|23:59|ok|23:59|last minute
time|7:05|ok|07:05|single-digit hour is padded
cidr|10.0.0.0/8|ok|10.0.0.0/8|shortest allowed prefix
cidr|10.0.0.0/30|ok|10.0.0.0/30|longest allowed prefix
cidr|10.0.0.0/7|bad||prefix too short
cidr|10.0.0.0/31|bad||prefix too long
ip|0.0.0.0|ok||all zeros
ip|255.255.255.255|ok||all ones
ip|1.2.3.4.5|bad||five octets
