unixuser|abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefg|bad||33 characters
model|vendor/model:free|ok||colon tag
model|vendor/|bad||nothing after the slash
gguf|a.b.gguf|ok||dots in the name
gguf|.gguf|bad||no name
winpath|C:\llama\sub|ok||nested folder
winpath|C:\|bad||drive root alone
kwargs|enable_thinking=true|ok||kwargs: one pair
kwargs|reasoning_effort=medium,enable_thinking=false|ok||kwargs: two pairs
kwargs|none|ok||kwargs: none
kwargs|auto|ok||kwargs: auto
kwargs|enable_thinking|bad||kwargs: no value
kwargs|a=1,,b=2|bad||kwargs: empty pair
kwargs|a=1,|bad||kwargs: trailing comma
kwargs|a=1,a=2|bad||kwargs: duplicate key
kwargs|a=1,A=2|ok||kwargs: keys are case-sensitive (two different keys)
kwargs|a=x y|bad||kwargs: space in value
kwargs|1a=x|bad||kwargs: key starts with a digit
kwargs|a=x;b|bad||kwargs: semicolon
sampling|--temp 0.6 --top-p 0.95 --top-k 20|ok||sampling: three pairs
sampling|--temp  0.6   --min-p 0|ok|--temp 0.6 --min-p 0|sampling: extra spaces normalised
sampling|--repeat-last-n -1|ok||sampling: negative number
sampling|none|ok||sampling: none
sampling|auto|ok||sampling: auto
sampling|--temp|bad||sampling: flag without value
sampling|--temp 0.6 --top-p|bad||sampling: odd count
sampling|--temp hot|bad||sampling: not a number
sampling|--model x.gguf|bad||sampling: not an allowed flag
sampling|--temp 0.6;rm|bad||sampling: injection attempt
sampling|-t 0.6|bad||sampling: short flag
